<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>预定成功 · flever 花艺定制</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="phone active">
  <div class="pay-ok">
    <div class="check">✓</div>
    <h2>预定成功</h2>
    <div class="order-no">订单号 <%= o.order_no %></div>
    <div class="queue">你的花将于 <%= o.queue_date %> 进入制作 · 当日第 <%= o.queue_pos %> 位</div>
    <a class="link-btn" href="/orders?phone=<%= o.phone %>">查看我的订单</a>
    <a class="link-btn" href="/">返回首页</a>
    <p style="font-size:11px;color:var(--faint);margin-top:20px;line-height:1.8">进度变化将通过服务号「flever 花艺定制」提醒你<br>建议开启消息通知</p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
